## intro
Tonight is the Thanksgiving party.
Difficulty: Normal.
The case: Mrs. Briefs' stand-in lies smashed in the Menagerie Yard. Whoever did it thought it was the real one.
Inspect the remains in the Menagerie Yard for the damage and the stand-in's last telemetry.
You have one hour before the case closes itself. Leaving the house or quitting closes it too.
Twelve people were at the party: Yamcha, Master Roshi, Launch, Mai, Mr. Satan, Tien, Gohan, Piccolo, Krillin, Android 18, Dende and Mr. Popo.
The house clock chimed four times that night, at nine, ten, eleven and midnight. Every story is told by those times.
The feast filled the Dining Room. Somewhere there is a seating chart.
